ed.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 vae/\n│          └── flux2-vae.safetensors\n```\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Model links", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [409.33013916015625, 406.4593200683594], "pos": [3018.38134765625, 215.2993927001953], "id": 64, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.3"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [67], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["一个 30 岁的男性艺术家，浓密的黑色卷发，络腮胡修剪整齐，深邃的眼眸，穿着白色衬衫搭配黑色背带裤，双手插在裤袋里，站在工作室窗前，窗外是雨后的城市，室内摆放着画架和颜料，温暖的灯光洒在脸上，表情专注而富有艺术气息，整体色调偏暖，展现出文艺青年的独特气质。"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 85, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 100, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [426.8844909667969, 328.91717529296875], "pos": [3841.503662109375, 267.47918701171875], "id": 71, "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.71", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.3"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [100], "label": "文本", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "显示帮助", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["这是一张极具氛围感与艺术性的女性肖像摄影作品，整体呈现出“纯欲”风格的美学特质——即在清纯与性感之间取得微妙平衡，既保留了少女的纯净感，又通过光影、姿态和细节传递出隐秘的诱惑力。作为一位专业的摄影师，我将从构图、布景、人物造型、光线运用、镜头语言到后期处理等维度，全面解析这张作品的摄影要素。 --- ### 一、**构图（Composition）** - **主体布局**： 模特位于画面中心偏右的位置，采用**三分法构图**